    kind: work_item  # aef1
    title: "io-boundaries and taint disagree on 18 of 1,488 edges: taint ignores io_target_kind (/dev/null, in-memory buffers) and reads process.on lifecycle handlers as untrusted input"  # aef1
    status: todo_hard  # aef1
    priority: 2  # aef1
    parent:  # aef1
